Cursor Rules

This repository contains a collection of .cursorrules files for use with Cursor AI.

# Project Structure
- The 'rules' directory contains categorized .cursorrules examples
- Each .cursorrules file is focused on a specific technology or framework
- The README.md contains the full catalog of available rules

# Coding Conventions
- Use consistent naming conventions
- Include helpful comments for complex logic

# Common Libraries and Tools
- List frequently used libraries and dependencies here
- Include preferred versions when applicable

# Style Guidelines
- Maintain consistent formatting
- Follow established patterns in existing code
- Use appropriate error handling

